msgid "The credential will be created only on this exact device"
msgstr "凭据将仅在此特定设备上创建"

msgid ""
"The deletion command finished, but the selected YubiKey could not be inspected afterward: {0}\n"
"The credential may or may not have been deleted. Do not retry. Reconnect and inspect the YubiKey first."
msgstr ""
"删除命令已结束，但随后无法检查所选的 YubiKey：{0}\n"
"凭据可能已被删除，也可能未删除。请勿重试。请重新连接并先检查 YubiKey。"

msgid "The enrollment task failed."
msgstr "注册任务失败。"

